title: Process flow
config:
  theme: default
nerdgram:
  description: A request moves through intake, a decision, and two swimlanes before it is closed.
  tags:
    - software
    - process
    - flowchart
  category: Software
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph intake [Intake]
        start[Request received] --> review[Review the request]
    end
    subgraph decide [Decision]
        review --> gate{Approved}
    end
    subgraph fulfill [Fulfillment]
        gate -->|Yes| build[Do the work]
        build --> close[Close the request]
    end
    subgraph stop [Stop]
        gate -->|No| reject[Send it back]
    end
